  "12501": {
    "Id": 12501,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "Lines": "很荣幸与您同行，请多指教。"
  },
  "12502": {
    "Id": 12502,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_gacha_001",
    "Lines": "人们都说“重逢令人欣喜”……魔王，您是怎么看的呢？"
  },
  "12503": {
    "Id": 12503,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "Lines": "我将铲除妨碍您的一切。"
  },
  "12504": {
    "Id": 12504,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "Lines": "我好像……开始喜欢下雨天了。"
  },
  "12505": {
    "Id": 12505,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 12503,
    "VoResource": "",
    "Lines": "她所期盼的雪愿节，是一炉温暖的火焰，一杯香甜的果酿，亲密好友的笑语，以及一份来自你的、独一无二的礼物。"
  },
  "12506": {
    "Id": 12506,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 12504,
    "VoResource": "",
    "Lines": "???"
  },
  "12601": {
    "Id": 12601,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "Lines": "初次见面，我是魔术师紫槿，也许你曾听过有关我的各种传闻……呵呵，很在意？但对于魔术来说，是真是假，又有什么关系呢？"
  },
  "12602": {
    "Id": 12602,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_gacha_001",
    "Lines": "同样的手法我不会演示两遍，这一次，请仔细看清楚了~"
  },
  "12603": {
    "Id": 12603,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "Lines": "盛大的演出就要开始了，将这份奇迹牢记于心吧！"
  },
  "12604": {
    "Id": 12604,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "Lines": "看入迷了？好啦，快点来帮忙吧，演出就要开始了。"
  },
  "12605": {
    "Id": 12605,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 12603,
    "VoResource": "",
    "Lines": "???"
  },
  "12606": {
    "Id": 12606,
